RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لَأَخَذْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a085982c0c72fd5dbc09.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}]}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْيَمِينِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "79:25", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5737.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So Allah seized him (and made him) an example for the after (life) and for the former.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah da onu tuttu, dünya ve ahiret azabıyla yakalayıverdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو اللہ نے اسے دنیا و آخرت دونوں کے عذاب میں پکڑا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka Allah mengazabnya dengan azab di akhirat dan azab di dunia.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَخَذَهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/88f7a9a38d17977dd940.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]}]}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَكَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "15:73", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1875.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then the (Awful) Cry overtook them at the sunrise.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Güneş doğarken o korkunç çığlık onları yakaladı.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو دن نکلتے انہیں چنگھاڑ نے آلیا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka mereka dibinasakan oleh suara keras yang mengguntur, ketika matahari akan terbit.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/daaf0e3c12e02af46f04.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa ih je zahvatio", "en": "then it seized them", "tr": "onları yakaladı", "fr": "les saisit", "id": "maka mereka dibinasakan", "ur": "پھر انہیں آ لیا", "bn": "অতঃপর তা তাদের পাকড়াও করল", "fa": "پس آنان را فرو گرفت"}}, {"text": "ٱلصَّيْحَةُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُشْرِقِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "44:47", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4461.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(And it will be said): Take him and drag him to the midst of hell,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah meleklere şöyle emreder. \"Şunu tutun da Cehennem'in ortasına sürükleyin.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اسے پکڑو ٹھیک بھڑکتی آگ کی طرف بزور گھسیٹتے لے جاؤ،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Peganglah dia kemudian seretlah dia ke tengah-tengah neraka.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "خُذُوهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/b7aa70733b3009264a63.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zgrabite ga", "en": "seize him", "tr": "tutun onu", "fr": "saisissez-le", "id": "peganglah dia", "ur": "اسے پکڑو", "bn": "তাকে ধর", "fa": "او را بگیرید"}}, {"text": "فَٱعْتِلُوهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَوَآءِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْجَحِيمِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:199", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1153.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Keep to forgiveness (O Muhammad), and enjoin kindness, and turn away from the ignorant.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sen yine de affa sarıl, iyiliği emret ve cahillerden yüz çevir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے محبوب! معاف کرنا اختیار کرو اور بھلائی کا حکم دو اور جاہلوں سے منہ پھیرلو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Jadilah engkau pemaaf dan suruhlah orang mengerjakan yang ma'ruf, serta berpalinglah dari pada orang-orang yang bodoh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "خُذِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6b78a9643be50fd1d403.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "take!", "bs": "uzmi!", "tr": "al!", "fr": "prends !", "id": "Ambillah!", "ur": "لے!", "bn": "নাও!", "fa": "بگیر!"}}, {"text": "ٱلْعَفْوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأْمُرْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْعُرْفِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَعْرِضْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "16:46", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1947.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Or that He will not seize them in their going to and fro so that there be no escape for them?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Yahut (rızık için) dolaşıp dururlarken (Allah'ın azabının) kendilerini yakalayıvermesinden emin mi oldular? Üstelik onlar, azabı engelleyici de değillerdir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "یا انہیں چلتے پھرتے پکڑ لے کہ وہ تھکا نہیں سکتے، ف۹۸)", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "atau Allah mengazab mereka diwaktu mereka dalam perjalanan, maka sekali-kali mereka tidak dapat menolak (azab itu),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَأْخُذَهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3317d298b0f37bc3a0f1.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "da ih zahvati", "en": "that He seize them", "tr": "onları yakalaması", "fr": "qu'Il les saisisse", "id": "Dia mengazab mereka", "ur": "انہیں پکڑ لے", "bn": "যে তিনি তাদের পাকড়াও করবেন", "fa": "که آنان را فرو گیرد"}}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَقَلُّبِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمُعْجِزِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "أَخَذْنَا", "count": 9, "first": "2:63", "audio": "audio/ef61689a7579ae452668.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "we took", "bs": "uzeli smo", "tr": "aldık", "fr": "nous avons pris", "id": "kami telah mengambil", "ur": "ہم نے لیا", "bn": "আমরা নিলাম", "fa": "گرفتیم"}}, {"arabic": "أَخَذَ", "count": 9, "first": "3:81", "audio": "audio/539002a65b2ca54fcee7.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it took", "bs": "uzeo je", "tr": "aldı", "fr": "il a pris", "id": "dia telah mengambil", "ur": "اُس نے لیا", "bn": "সে নিল", "fa": "گرفت"}}, {"arabic": "فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ", "count": 8, "first": "4:153", "audio": "audio/ab716736d37a3ee9dcc1.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"bs": "pa ih je zahvatio", "en"